            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Menarini Richerche is developing nepadutant, an NK2 antagonist, for the potential treatment of asthma and irritable bowel syndrome. The compound is in phase IIa trials in Belgium and Sweden for both these indications [359518].</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
